From: odin-port <odin@port.local>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 00:07:35 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] dt-bindings: vendor-prefixes: add Smartisan

Add the smartisan vendor prefix for Smartisan Digital Co., Ltd.,
needed for the MSM8953-based Smartisan ODIN (U2 Pro) device.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
index c7591b2ae..618003a5f 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
@@ -1527,6 +1527,8 @@ patternProperties:
     description: Sony Corporation
   "^sophgo,.*":
     description: Sophgo Technology Inc.
+  "^smartisan,.*":
+    description: Smartisan Digital Co., Ltd.
   "^sourceparts,.*":
     description: Source Parts Inc.
   "^spacemit,.*":
-- 
